### Requests go through the Gateway (8080). Writing needs a token from POST /api/v1/auth/login.
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create a post (locationId comes from the Location Service, may be null)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My first TounsiGuide recommendation",
  "locationId": 1
}

### 2. List all posts
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts

### 3. Get one post
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts/1

### 4. Update the post
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My updated TounsiGuide recommendation",
  "locationId": null
}

### 5. Delete the post
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Confirm deletion
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/posts/1
